{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 13, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " Upon the land of the rising sun, a journey shalt thou embark\nTo behold the wonders of Nippon, thy heart with joy shall embark\n\nDay the first: In the city of Tokyo, the adventure begins\nWhere neon lights and ancient traditions, in harmony exist\nVisit the Meiji Shrine, where tranquility doth reign\nThence to the Shibuya Crossing, where chaos and order, twain\n\nDay the second: Explore the Sensoji Temple, a sight to behold\nIts majestic pagodas, to the heavens, reach untold\nIn Asakusa, indulge in street food, flavors to thee unfold\nThence to Ueno Park, where cherry blossoms, a beautiful sight, doth unfold\n\nDay the third: To Nikko, a city nestled in the mountains, ascend\nWhere nature and culture, hand in hand, do blend\nThe Toshogu Shrine, a masterpiece of art, behold\nThence to Lake Chuzenji, where serenity doth unfold\n\nDay the fourth: To Kyoto, the city of a thousand temples, travel\nWhere geishas and samurais, in the past, did revel\nThe Fushimi Inari Shrine, with its iconic torii gates, ascend\nThence to the Kinkakuji Temple, where gold and nature, intertwine, blend\n\nDay the fifth: Explore Arashiyama, where bamboo groves, a sight to behold\nThence to the Tenryuji Temple, a UNESCO World Heritage, enroll\nIn Gion, indulge in a traditional tea ceremony, partake\nThence to Nijo Castle, where history, in its walls, doth awake\n\nDay the sixth: To Hiroshima, where peace and hope, intertwine\nBehold the Atomic Bomb Dome, a reminder of a dark past, yet divine\nIn Miyajima, the Itsukushima Shrine, a torii gate in the sea, find\nThence to Hiroshima Castle, where history, in its walls, doth unwind\n\nDay the seventh: To Osaka, the city of neon lights, a modern sight\nThe Umeda Sky Building, where a panoramic view, doth ignite\nThe Osaka Castle, a symbol of power, behold\nThence to the Dotonbori, where food and fun, a beautiful sight, unfold\n\nSo ends thy journey, a memory to thee, unfold\nIn the land of Japan, where culture and history, intertwine, behold\nMay the memories of this journey, forever in thy heart, dwell\nThence to home, with a heart full of joy, bid farewell, farewell.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Upon", "logprob": -0.308956116437912}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.021099278703331947}, {"token": "land", "logprob": -2.0090999603271484}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.0647345781326294}, {"token": "rising", "logprob": -0.007630487438291311}, {"token": "sun", "logprob": -3.135155202471651e-05}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.5784611105918884}, {"token": "a", "logprob": -0.06554947793483734}, {"token": "journey", "logprob": -0.0028639512602239847}, {"token": "sh", "logprob": -1.3501312732696533}, {"token": "alt", "logprob": -2.7418097943154862e-06}, {"token": "thou", "logprob": -0.0014063954586163163}, {"token": "emb", "logprob": -0.003378281369805336}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.06262645125389099}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -3.666126251220703}, {"token": "beh", "logprob": -1.8286077976226807}, {"token": "old", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.013883564621210098}, {"token": "w", "logprob": -0.26003730297088623}, {"token": "onders", "logprob": -0.00043084874050691724}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -0.0013302058214321733}, {"token": "N", "logprob": -1.0045788288116455}, {"token": "ip", "logprob": -0.00020382710499688983}, {"token": "pon", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.08939022570848465}, {"token": "thy", "logprob": -1.6849790811538696}, {"token": "heart", "logprob": -0.010239922441542149}, {"token": "with", "logprob": -0.0018941095331683755}, {"token": "joy", "logprob": -0.05377628281712532}, {"token": "shall", "logprob": -0.3027111887931824}, {"token": "emb", "logprob": -0.18383342027664185}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -6.437280717364047e-06}, {"token": "\